WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:07.300
A world of luxury,
right at your fingertips.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.660
(SINGING) All night.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.730
This could be
unlike anything else.

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.187
(SINGING) All night.

00:00:12.187 --> 00:00:13.220
Going to make a lot of money.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.044
Yeah!

00:00:14.044 --> 00:00:15.980
(SINGING) Oh, every night.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:17.123
Trust me.

00:00:17.123 --> 00:00:19.390
(SINGING) So hold tight.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:20.470
This is my life.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.240
(SINGING) Hold tight.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.004
Every cent I have,
I've put into this.

00:00:25.004 --> 00:00:26.450
I hate it!

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.020
You and me
stick together.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.910
Or you and me go to war.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.420
MAN 3: Are you ready for
the time of your life?

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:36.370
MAN 1: You can't
take this personally.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.303
This is business.
[CHEERING]

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:38.670
[MUSIC - JOURNEY, "ANY WAY YOU
 WANT IT"]

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.000
(SINGING) She said
any way you want it,

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.100
that's the way you need it.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.850
Any way you want it.

